[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584422\">1064A11</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) (1b) and remove the turbocharger bracket (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021928.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584422\">1064A11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the protection (1b) for the engine\noil return pipe from the turbocharger.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021929.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a), loosen collar (1b), then remove the engine\noil return pipe from the turbocharger (1c) with flange.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021930.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the engine oil return pipe from the\nturbo with flange and then tighten the bolts and collar.</p><p>Replace the protection for the engine oil\nreturn pipe from the turbocharger and secure using the bolts.</p><p>Place the turbocharger mounting bracket\nback in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]